    #1980: I9.4 canonizes two objects; admission envelope renamed DreamJobAdmission (#1983)
    
    * work(1980): rename contracts envelope DreamJobInput to DreamJobAdmission
    
    One causal change: resolve the I9.4 name collision per owner decision on #1980.
    The admission envelope (job.rs) takes DreamJobAdmission; bundle::DreamInputBundle,
    bins/eliot-dreamer flat struct (#1978) and dreamer-core facade (#1143) untouched.
    No aliases, no From/Into bridges; module.toml envelope lines renamed.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * work(1980): amend I9.4 to canonize admission envelope and semantic bundle
    
    I9.4 now names DreamJobAdmission (closed intake record) alongside DreamJobInput
    (the role-addressed semantic bundle), with required roles per class, per-role
    cardinality/lineage, omission rules, denominator source and BundleCompleteness
    states, each grounded in assembly/recipe.rs and bundle types. Regenerate the
    serde boundary inventory through scripts/serde_boundary_inventory.py sync
    (check PASS); envelope row now keys on DreamJobAdmission.
    
